g is a part of reading price. Also u need to understand key ENG, key DP. LOOK AT slowly charts and follow the price ( for example any chart H4 and analyse it) and u see many interesting If u have questions, please ask","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#335","p":14,"im":["a6a8f6d5f94917bad8ef7d6092789387afdd9d4d","64501ac6fa54053ac7669e270d8f71fee5339dbd"],"m":335},{"id":"alex_p14_336","t":"Away\n\nhiii alex... really nice journal what u got... what do you think about my EJ trade...","a":"gembel","d":"","n":"#336","p":14,"im":["05245df4fd9b1c615aab095bf1f1af4839dcf3b9"],"m":336},{"id":"alex_p14_337","t":"Hi, I made some corrections, DP is little higher. U see - no Eng DP ( but we have 2TB of DP). I`m waiting for struggle in this point where u pointed. I liked your chart (very clear )","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#337","p":14,"im":["12a60c04f7f354fd49df01ada4b7aebc1ede0439"],"m":337},{"id":"alex_p14_338","t":"Away\n\nthx alot......closed 54p.. bought EJ... TG1 should be flag.. still watching PA...","a":"gembel","d":"","n":"#338","p":14,"im":["cd35d354d141483b22a8aa3b31f3a89d8b52deb1"],"m":338},{"id":"alex_p14_339","t":"Away\n\nhi alex... i would like to ask you something.. previous EJ hitted SL... missed TG1 then hoping PA will bounced from below DP (newbie mistake) i have some issue with flag i would like to ask about purple flag.. is that reaction or just engulfed?","a":"gembel","d":"","n":"#339","p":14,"im":["ccd1f2d1d5ad0334a8583a2965f99d52daded40b"],"m":339},{"id":"alex_p14_340","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#340","p":14,"im":["69ca6da34321512753e21b46f581e6b796afadf1"],"m":340},{"id":"alex_p14_341","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#341","p":14,"im":["da3026df8b101ef116c578d20138d9a623b97e0d"],"m":341},{"id":"alex_p14_342","t":"Hi there Alex,\n\nThanks for your previous help regarding your understanding on DP and key levels. It helped me strengthen my confidence\n\nAnyway, about your last GBPUSD chart, I wonder what is your reason to draw the last (lowest) blue box there after engulfed? Are you zoning the obvious swings, which indicated by your yellow zigzag lines? This is what I saw in M5 on my chart:\n\nIn M1, it's a QM level after engulfing the pink FL.","a":"charlespips","d":"","n":"#342","p":14,"im":["21810686bbca5c9ad7768a44c8000b9f8894b887"],"m":342},{"id":"alex_p14_343","t":"Lowest Blue box is FTR (Gbp\\USD)","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#343","p":14,"im":["f650ef5f1e5e6cb2cf1d49f338f026c274160050"],"m":343},{"id":"alex_p14_344","t":"Kovalenko wrote: Lowest Blue box is FTR (Gbp\\USD)\n\nHi Kovalenko.\n\nYour chart is saying Eur/Usd - not the Gbp/Usd\n\nNice trade Btw\n\nRegards,\n\nHans","a":"hansma","d":"","n":"#344","p":14,"im":["f650ef5f1e5e6cb2cf1d49f338f026c274160050"],"m":344},{"id":"alex_p14_345","t":"Hi, these words were for CP. (Previous question)","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#345","p":14,"im":[],"m":345},{"id":"alex_p14_346","t":"Kovalenko wrote: Lowest Blue box is FTR (Gbp\\USD)\n\nlooks like my entry to the pip","a":"to","d":"","n":"#346","p":14,"im":["f650ef5f1e5e6cb2cf1d49f338f026c274160050","702e2d65c2f5637b0997d93d741699f1d047a164"],"m":346},{"id":"alex_p14_347","t":"Kovalenko wrote: Lowest Blue box is FTR (Gbp\\USD)\n\nOh my! Completely forgot about FTR zoning inside FL! I've been too focus on FL recently and almost forgot other puzzle pieces. Thanks for reminding, it's really a valuable short phrase & simple chart that jolted my bad memory.","a":"charlespips","d":"","n":"#347","p":14,"im":[],"m":347},{"id":"alex_p14_348","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#348","p":14,"im":["b4963dee337aefd151a2ffce0c4490b57fd05f01","352d8ee4069f190ea78e94cda627159466decf56","1fbf4497f930690493a1e976ac10ab18d8be86de"],"m":348},{"id":"alex_p14_349","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#349","p":14,"im":["3a0b087f594e771f4b7fee1ccb4b80bb059a7183"],"m":349},{"id":"alex_p14_350","t":"NZD\\JPY - 2 trades today","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#350","p":14,"im":["0f356a9d6e910e1c7cb4e659e87f8c4f534042d8"],"m":350}],"images":[